WEBVTT

00:00:07.670 --> 00:00:10.630
It's been too long, Uncle Viktor.

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:14.220
It certainly has, Torri.

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:16.970
This is my wife, Vera.

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:20.140
It's a pleasure, madam.

00:00:20.390 --> 00:00:22.520
Thank you for inviting us.

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:27.060
It seems that bombing wiped out
most of the pro-special-zone advocates.

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.400
It's a relief, in a sense.

00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:32.240
This headquarters has grown.

00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:34.860
Yes, as we've gained adherents,

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:39.870
we've expanded our system
to deliver our teachings more effectively.

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:42.580
Here, Uncle Viktor.

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:45.420
Your usual security passes.

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:46.580
Thank you.

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:57.180
OK, this place looks safe.

00:00:58.430 --> 00:00:59.850
We got in successfully.

00:01:01.220 --> 00:01:03.270
They didn't suspect us at all.

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:06.060
Unauthorized full-body holos are illegal.

00:01:06.270 --> 00:01:08.230
I doubt they would be expecting them.

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:10.270
Um...

00:01:10.610 --> 00:01:11.320
What is it?

00:01:11.820 --> 00:01:14.280
I'm sorry about what happened earlier.

00:01:14.780 --> 00:01:19.030
You shielded me from the blast.
I won't disgrace myself like that again.

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:20.240
Don't worry.

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:22.700
Please do the same for me.

00:01:24.290 --> 00:01:25.040
Yes, sir.

00:01:25.160 --> 00:01:29.790
First, we search for bombs and
Sister Shinogi, thought to be in hiding.

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:33.340
And the reclusive founder, Nisei.

00:01:33.880 --> 00:01:34.800
Yes.

00:01:36.050 --> 00:01:39.970
That's the rundown
on the serial terrorist bombings.

00:01:40.470 --> 00:01:44.560
The undercover investigation's just begun,
so I can't comment on it.

00:01:45.230 --> 00:01:49.940
Apart from that, we're reinvestigating
the previous inspectors' accident.

00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:53.320
That's all.

00:01:55.570 --> 00:01:56.320
Disgusting.

00:01:58.990 --> 00:02:01.280
I don't approve of what you're doing.

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:03.240
Yes, ma'am.

00:02:03.370 --> 00:02:07.120
Prioritize the present Unit One,
not the past one.

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:09.460
Yes, ma'am. Of course.

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:13.550
Draw the knives
locked behind your eyelids.

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:17.260
Reap the lives that grow into shackles.

00:02:17.420 --> 00:02:21.050
Even the lost memories that flee
once they're liberated and banished

00:02:21.220 --> 00:02:24.010
Are an everlasting cubism.

00:02:39.030 --> 00:02:44.790
Cause I know that in a future gone mad,

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:48.540
Even nightmares are peaceful.

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:50.580
RESET, RESET, yeah.

00:02:50.710 --> 00:02:54.590
The midnight sun
awakens and turns to a riot.

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:58.920
A gun for a faux-friendly kiss.
A knife for a faux-revolutionary hug.

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:05.430
Get rid of it all, even the frozen chains.

00:03:05.640 --> 00:03:09.390
Reality is always outside your head.

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:13.940
In a world seen through bestial eyes,

00:03:14.230 --> 00:03:20.070
There is neither darkness nor light.

00:03:24.490 --> 00:03:27.790
Draw the knives
locked behind your eyelids.

00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:31.460
Reap the lives that grow into shackles.

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:35.130
Even the false memories that flash before
your eyes impatiently and impulsively

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:37.800
Are an everlasting cubism.

00:03:41.050 --> 00:03:43.970
#06
Caesar's Gold Coins

00:03:44.140 --> 00:03:46.300
I decoded the data we found.

00:03:46.600 --> 00:03:51.440
Sister Shinogi and Kurisu O'Brien
jointly rent a warehouse.

00:03:51.730 --> 00:03:54.980
They deliver a lot of goods
to New Town from there.

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:03.110
We've arrived. Starting the investigation.

00:04:03.570 --> 00:04:07.950
According to my data, Sister Shinogi
and O'Brien from Immigration

00:04:08.450 --> 00:04:12.790
definitely worked to expedite
the naturalization process for refugees.

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:16.500
The condition was abandoning
their property. So, a bribe?

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:21.510
Yes. And because they disarmed
refugees in Dejima,

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:25.010
they could have obtained
military explosives.

00:04:25.180 --> 00:04:25.970
OK.

00:04:26.090 --> 00:04:27.510
Nothing hazardous here.

00:04:31.310 --> 00:04:34.190
Five beds showing signs of use.

00:04:34.350 --> 00:04:38.150
Meaning there are
three more human bombs?

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:40.980
I'm picking up trace amounts
of vaporized elements.

00:04:41.230 --> 00:04:44.110
They match the explosive used
in the attack.

00:04:44.610 --> 00:04:47.530
Shion, do you have management data
for this place?

00:04:47.700 --> 00:04:49.120
It's all intact.

00:04:49.490 --> 00:04:52.500
The destination is the factory
in New Town.

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:56.830
That's Auma's turf.
He has to know about it.

00:04:57.040 --> 00:04:58.000
They're linked.

00:04:58.380 --> 00:05:00.500
Sister Shinogi and Auma.

00:05:05.010 --> 00:05:08.260
At present, we have
roughly 40 thousand adherents.

00:05:08.390 --> 00:05:13.060
Of those, around 500 lead
a communal life in our headquarters.

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:15.850
As immigrants with clouded Hues,

00:05:16.230 --> 00:05:20.480
they would otherwise be passed
from facility to facility.

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:25.610
It was Founder Nisei who reached out
a hand of salvation to them.

00:05:26.030 --> 00:05:29.990
Their Hues improved quickly
upon their conversion.

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:31.700
Magnificent.

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:35.210
I'd like to speak to Mr. Nisei.
It's been so long.

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:39.710
Very well. I will take you to him.

00:05:49.470 --> 00:05:51.350
My humble apologies,

00:05:51.890 --> 00:05:55.890
but he is engaged in special prayer.
No one may speak to him.

00:05:57.060 --> 00:05:58.980
He prays all the time?

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:03.110
Yes. When true inner peace comes to him,

00:06:03.900 --> 00:06:06.820
he will deign to speak with us once more.

00:06:08.450 --> 00:06:09.990
Let go of me!

00:06:10.280 --> 00:06:12.080
Be silent, bottom.

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:14.120
How violent.

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:19.920
A bottom, one of our least faithful
adherents, must have caused trouble.

00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:22.130
Who were the masked people?

00:06:22.790 --> 00:06:26.130
They're called "doctors,"
a rank we recently established.

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:28.590
They are the elite here.

00:06:32.010 --> 00:06:34.760
I'm terribly sorry you had to see that.

00:06:35.140 --> 00:06:38.940
This is the leader of the doctors,
Dr. Saburo Nihei.

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:42.610
Pleased to make your acquaintance.

00:06:43.820 --> 00:06:47.280
We'll have to sneak by them
to talk to the founder.

00:06:47.610 --> 00:06:48.320
Yes, sir.

00:06:48.490 --> 00:06:53.950
During the day, we'll join in the therapy
and gather information from members.

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:56.660
We'll participate in the therapy?

00:06:57.120 --> 00:06:58.290
Is that a problem?

00:06:59.870 --> 00:07:03.920
It's just not possible to improve
your Hue that quickly.

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:06.880
Why do they believe that fraud?

00:07:07.170 --> 00:07:09.470
Does religion just prey on the weak?

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:17.470
Maybe they need someone to reach out
to them when everyone has abandoned them.

00:07:19.390 --> 00:07:21.020
I'm surprised you'd say that.

00:07:21.600 --> 00:07:23.980
What kind of person do you think I am?

00:07:24.860 --> 00:07:27.190
A person who doesn't need help.

00:07:29.440 --> 00:07:31.200
Everyone needs help.

00:07:49.760 --> 00:07:51.010
What the...?

00:07:56.550 --> 00:08:01.390
Short-term treatment of your wife's Hue
may prove difficult.

00:08:02.060 --> 00:08:04.020
I advise long-term therapy.

00:08:04.190 --> 00:08:08.860
I'd like her to be able to live
in this country soon. Can you help us?

00:08:10.570 --> 00:08:13.490
Actually, there is a method
called Eternal White.

00:08:13.820 --> 00:08:18.080
It's a treatment that can keep
any Hue clear for good.

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:19.160
Torri, sir.

00:08:20.410 --> 00:08:23.710
There's been another bombing.
Joseph Auma is dead.

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:26.500
The factory district sustained damage.

00:08:31.840 --> 00:08:32.550
Uncle Viktor,

00:08:33.470 --> 00:08:36.850
we've secured sufficient packages for you.

00:08:37.550 --> 00:08:40.180
Would you like to check them,
if you're uncertain?

00:08:40.720 --> 00:08:42.390
Yes, I'd like that.

00:08:43.060 --> 00:08:47.400
Venerable Auma!
Why did this have to happen?

00:08:48.520 --> 00:08:51.150
So, a bomb got him in the end.

00:08:54.320 --> 00:08:56.740
The suicide bomber was Samuel Minnie,

00:08:57.280 --> 00:08:59.660
a former member of Heaven's Leap.

00:08:59.950 --> 00:09:02.790
Wasn't Auma in league with the perps?

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:07.080
And unlike the other victims,
he's anti-special-zone.

00:09:17.550 --> 00:09:19.430
Forget it, Inspector.

00:09:20.310 --> 00:09:21.350
Forget what?

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:24.810
You'll collapse like you did before.

00:09:28.440 --> 00:09:29.810
I'm curious about that.

00:09:30.730 --> 00:09:36.450
Why did Joseph Auma
flee all the way here in a truck?

00:09:36.780 --> 00:09:39.280
Did he know a bomber was coming?

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:40.950
Yes, probably.

00:09:41.660 --> 00:09:47.540
And he didn't run. He knocked the bomber
into the reservoir and died with him.

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:49.920
Was it to protect the factory?

00:09:50.500 --> 00:09:53.130
This facility supplies water
to the factory.

00:09:53.590 --> 00:09:57.130
The factory couldn't run
if it were destroyed.

00:09:58.590 --> 00:10:02.350
But on that side,
there's only a dilapidated old building.

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:03.600
I see.

00:10:04.220 --> 00:10:07.730
Letting it go off in the storehouse
would have caused less damage.

00:10:08.140 --> 00:10:08.980
Meaning...

00:10:09.310 --> 00:10:13.110
Joseph Auma died defending it.

00:10:29.370 --> 00:10:31.880
Look what they've been hiding.

00:10:37.090 --> 00:10:39.010
What the hell are you running here?!

00:10:39.180 --> 00:10:40.180
Nothing.

00:10:40.890 --> 00:10:46.350
Their pimp was a pro-special-zone
advocate, who died in the attack.

00:10:47.180 --> 00:10:51.690
We took the opportunity to help them
escape their brothels.

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:56.230
I've heard that an organization
is forcing immigrants

00:10:56.610 --> 00:11:00.360
at risk of deportation
for deteriorating Hues into prostitution.

00:11:00.490 --> 00:11:03.450
Why don't they report it to Public Safety?

00:11:03.780 --> 00:11:06.200
When they could all be latent criminals?

00:11:08.080 --> 00:11:11.120
Joseph Auma
opposed the prostitution ring.

00:11:11.710 --> 00:11:15.500
He gave up his life to protect them
because they couldn't escape.

00:11:15.670 --> 00:11:17.050
That's right.

00:11:17.300 --> 00:11:21.130
They're all gonna be institutionalized.
What'll you do?

00:11:22.430 --> 00:11:24.050
We'll protect them.

00:11:24.510 --> 00:11:28.140
What can you do without Joseph Auma?!

00:11:29.020 --> 00:11:30.060
Well...

00:11:31.520 --> 00:11:33.020
I'll work something out.

00:11:37.230 --> 00:11:39.150
I'd like to use Dejima.

00:11:39.610 --> 00:11:42.320
Where did this come from?

00:11:43.410 --> 00:11:48.080
My subordinates found a large number
of immigrants forced into prostitution.

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:52.250
I see. You want to move them
to Dejima for psychological care?

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:56.590
I really don't care what happens
to immigrants with clouded Hues.

00:11:56.960 --> 00:11:59.840
I'm saying I'll owe you one. Understand?

00:12:02.340 --> 00:12:05.850
People don't bow and scrape
to people they can't stand

00:12:06.390 --> 00:12:09.680
for things they don't care about.

00:12:12.310 --> 00:12:13.600
I'll see to it.

00:12:15.060 --> 00:12:19.360
By the way, you're not looking
into Heaven's Leap, are you?

00:12:20.780 --> 00:12:22.070
What do you mean?

00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:24.200
Stay out of our business.

00:12:25.070 --> 00:12:29.700
It's our jurisdiction. If anyone's
not minding their own business, it's you.

00:12:30.160 --> 00:12:32.080
You can play dumb if you like,

00:12:32.620 --> 00:12:35.920
but try not to get too deep in my debt.

00:12:38.130 --> 00:12:39.500
This is Shimotsuki.

00:12:39.880 --> 00:12:40.590
How'd it go?

00:12:40.840 --> 00:12:42.720
I've worked something out.

00:12:43.680 --> 00:12:48.390
But your job is to protect people
with healthy Hues. Understand?

00:12:49.010 --> 00:12:49.890
Yes, ma'am.

00:12:50.770 --> 00:12:55.980
You can show pity on the weak, but don't
forget the Public Safety Bureau's mission.

00:12:56.440 --> 00:12:57.730
Keep that in mind.

00:13:00.780 --> 00:13:02.610
We'll give them care at Dejima.

00:13:04.650 --> 00:13:07.490
Venerable Auma would be delighted.

00:13:09.580 --> 00:13:12.910
Auma must have been protecting
more than them.

00:13:13.960 --> 00:13:16.040
Show us what's through here.

00:13:38.520 --> 00:13:40.150
Now we have proof.

00:13:49.910 --> 00:13:53.790
The anti-special-zone faction
is linked to a smuggling group?

00:13:56.160 --> 00:13:57.000
Yes.

00:13:58.540 --> 00:13:59.920
There's no doubt.

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:04.670
That alone would be enough evidence
for a compulsory search.

00:14:05.090 --> 00:14:07.840
This organization won't
go down so easily.

00:14:08.680 --> 00:14:11.100
We need the founder's confession
and a bomb.

00:14:21.940 --> 00:14:24.570
This is the last place we haven't looked.

00:14:47.340 --> 00:14:50.300
Grant this soul
the grace of Eternal White.

00:14:52.800 --> 00:14:54.890
May Sibyl's blessings be upon you.

00:15:05.150 --> 00:15:09.360
They look like life-support devices
for people in vegetative states.

00:15:10.660 --> 00:15:12.620
Are all of these...?

00:15:23.920 --> 00:15:27.800
They're participants in that "program."
Their charts are in here.

00:15:30.510 --> 00:15:31.470
Look at this.

00:15:33.140 --> 00:15:36.010
Marcel Cotard. The suicide bomber.

00:15:36.930 --> 00:15:38.140
The notes are strange.

00:15:39.020 --> 00:15:42.060
"Attention required."
"CO-related subject."

00:15:42.270 --> 00:15:43.860
"Add to expunge list."

00:15:45.360 --> 00:15:47.780
The second bomber has a chart, too.

00:15:48.150 --> 00:15:49.360
CO-Related

00:15:49.490 --> 00:15:51.990
"Related subject" and "expunge"...

00:15:52.110 --> 00:15:55.240
There are five charts marked "CO-Related."

00:15:55.830 --> 00:15:57.330
As many as there are bombs.

00:15:58.370 --> 00:16:01.620
All the bombers qualified for the program.

00:16:01.750 --> 00:16:04.380
All five were moved to New Town first.

00:16:05.380 --> 00:16:07.670
Probably with Sister Shinogi.

00:16:09.380 --> 00:16:11.050
The representative's signature?

00:16:11.670 --> 00:16:13.800
Torri Aschenbach.

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:16.430
Is he the mastermind?

00:16:19.720 --> 00:16:23.480
Little Torri's doing well.
Don't you agree, madam?

00:16:23.690 --> 00:16:25.310
Who are you calling "madam"?

00:16:25.860 --> 00:16:28.520
You don't need to butter me up.

00:16:28.820 --> 00:16:30.690
I beg your pardon.

00:16:31.320 --> 00:16:34.950
Still, this Special Religious Zone
is a tough task.

00:16:35.490 --> 00:16:36.870
I mean it.

00:16:37.070 --> 00:16:38.990
Thank you for the warning.

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:42.500
Do you want to be a congressman?

00:16:42.750 --> 00:16:47.670
Yes, all inspectors
aim for that lofty position.

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:50.800
To get closer to the truth of the world.

00:16:51.090 --> 00:16:53.170
Truth, you say?

00:16:53.880 --> 00:16:55.470
Have I ever told you?

00:16:55.800 --> 00:16:59.810
The only equal to Sibyl
in our society is Bifrost.

00:17:00.560 --> 00:17:03.100
I know that, of course.

00:17:04.770 --> 00:17:08.690
Do your best to be chosen by Roundrobin.

00:17:11.110 --> 00:17:13.070
I call for an Inspection motion.

00:17:13.780 --> 00:17:15.570
As a Relation Hedge,

00:17:15.740 --> 00:17:21.240
I propose bailouts for the iron,
steel, and energy industries.

00:17:21.620 --> 00:17:23.290
I oppose the motion.

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:25.830
I second the motion.

00:17:26.370 --> 00:17:28.670
Invest in rail transportation.

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:31.380
Disperse the production base.

00:17:31.630 --> 00:17:34.220
Generate reemployment for laborers.

00:17:34.590 --> 00:17:37.720
Oh, my. Have you turned pro-special-zone?

00:17:38.090 --> 00:17:39.970
I oppose the special zone.

00:17:40.930 --> 00:17:43.930
But for the sake
of restoring predatory economics,

00:17:44.140 --> 00:17:49.560
I agree to making New Town
an international black market relay.

00:17:50.270 --> 00:17:52.440
Then the motion is passed.

00:17:52.980 --> 00:17:57.740
Isn't it extravagant for the dealer
to propose a Relation Hedge?

00:17:58.160 --> 00:18:00.320
Have you guessed the relation?

00:18:00.530 --> 00:18:02.240
I wonder.

00:18:02.660 --> 00:18:04.870
The way you're going about this, Shizuka,

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:10.750
you stand to incur incalculable losses
if Public Safety's investigation fails.

00:18:11.210 --> 00:18:13.960
That will be the end for me, then.

00:18:17.090 --> 00:18:22.100
So, these attacks are basically
to crush the pro-special-zone advocates?

00:18:22.390 --> 00:18:25.770
It looks like
there's more to it than that.

00:18:25.930 --> 00:18:31.110
If we assume they had other reasons
to kill the bombing victims...

00:18:31.310 --> 00:18:34.030
This seems likely to be involved.

00:18:34.940 --> 00:18:37.190
It was among Joseph Auma's effects.

00:18:37.570 --> 00:18:41.570
I've identified it as a memento
of a refugee protection group in Dejima.

00:18:43.160 --> 00:18:44.950
I think the Sister had one, too.

00:18:45.160 --> 00:18:48.290
Yes. They were given to four people.

00:18:48.710 --> 00:18:50.960
Kurisu, Nisei,

00:18:51.250 --> 00:18:53.380
Shinogi, and Auma.

00:18:53.840 --> 00:18:56.960
There was a microchip
in the watch face.

00:18:57.550 --> 00:18:58.920
What's on it?

00:18:59.510 --> 00:19:02.550
It looks like some kind of plan.

00:19:02.930 --> 00:19:05.890
It would require multiple chips
to reconstruct it.

00:19:06.180 --> 00:19:09.100
Multiple? You mean all four?

00:19:09.390 --> 00:19:10.850
Without a doubt.

00:19:11.520 --> 00:19:13.940
What about the parts from the factory?

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:18.440
They're "bolts,"
parts for foreign-made assault rifles.

00:19:18.610 --> 00:19:20.950
I'm confused again.

00:19:21.200 --> 00:19:26.330
Auma was helping prostitution victims
and smuggling guns at the same time?

00:19:26.450 --> 00:19:27.950
It doesn't add up.

00:19:28.200 --> 00:19:31.460
There must be a reason.
Let's look into it.

00:19:35.540 --> 00:19:38.960
I know someone who knows their way
around these things.

00:19:39.380 --> 00:19:42.260
You mind coming with me for a bit,
Inspector?

00:19:50.180 --> 00:19:51.440
This is the place.

00:19:51.810 --> 00:19:54.190
Antiques Shop

00:19:54.900 --> 00:19:55.940
Follow me.

00:19:59.990 --> 00:20:02.360
An antique shop?

00:20:02.820 --> 00:20:07.870
A gun-nut rich kid ended up
becoming a fence in the slums.

00:20:10.290 --> 00:20:13.370
Well, if it isn't Irie!
I thought you were dead!

00:20:13.620 --> 00:20:16.880
Don't go killing me off,
or I'll kill you, moron.

00:20:17.090 --> 00:20:19.880
But I heard Public Safety nabbed you.

00:20:20.170 --> 00:20:23.050
I'm a gumshoe for Public Safety now.

00:20:23.300 --> 00:20:25.010
He's my boss, an inspector.

00:20:25.140 --> 00:20:25.890
What?!

00:20:26.140 --> 00:20:30.680
Listen, my boss is just itching
to kill someone.

00:20:32.440 --> 00:20:33.890
You got that right.

00:20:34.400 --> 00:20:37.150
I killed four people just yesterday.

00:20:39.150 --> 00:20:40.230
For real?

00:20:40.360 --> 00:20:42.070
Does this ring any bells?

00:20:43.280 --> 00:20:46.530
That's a high-quality bolt for an AK-Alfa!

00:20:46.660 --> 00:20:48.620
Where'd you get it?

00:20:50.240 --> 00:20:53.910
Don't play dumb.
How are you selling these?

00:20:54.040 --> 00:20:59.090
No idea. A semi-automatic rifle is more
than a slum-dweller can hope for.

00:20:59.250 --> 00:21:02.550
A factory was mass-producing these.

00:21:02.920 --> 00:21:05.430
There must be plenty on the black market.

00:21:05.720 --> 00:21:07.600
So that must be...

00:21:09.390 --> 00:21:10.640
You know something?

00:21:10.810 --> 00:21:16.440
There are rumors about Japanese-
made standardized parts on the market.

00:21:16.850 --> 00:21:18.190
You mean domestically?

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:20.110
They're distributed overseas.

00:21:20.320 --> 00:21:25.450
I hear high-quality Japanese parts
sell like crazy in conflict zones.

00:21:26.320 --> 00:21:30.080
But I also hear they might break
in weird ways.

00:21:30.740 --> 00:21:36.460
Well, precision parts are valuable, so
they go for prices you wouldn't believe.

00:21:50.680 --> 00:21:52.430
My holo is running low.

00:21:53.390 --> 00:21:55.600
We have no time. Turn it off.

00:22:03.570 --> 00:22:04.650
Founder Nisei.

00:22:11.700 --> 00:22:12.660
A hologram.

00:22:25.050 --> 00:22:25.800
Inspector.

00:22:39.400 --> 00:22:41.480
So, he's the real Nisei?

00:22:41.900 --> 00:22:45.480
He's alive, but in a vegetative state.

00:22:46.570 --> 00:22:49.150
He couldn't direct crimes
in this condition.

00:22:49.280 --> 00:22:51.370
Who's there?

00:22:54.490 --> 00:22:55.660
Oh, Torri.

00:22:56.040 --> 00:22:58.500
Uncle Viktor. What are you doing here?

00:22:59.000 --> 00:23:01.210
I just wanted to speak to the founder.

00:23:01.670 --> 00:23:04.630
I'm shocked. Why didn't you tell me?

00:23:07.460 --> 00:23:09.050
Mulberry purple.

00:23:09.800 --> 00:23:12.220
A Hue this clouded means quarantine.

00:23:12.760 --> 00:23:16.060
It's my Hue when I converted, madam.

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:18.730
You recovered from this state?

00:23:19.270 --> 00:23:22.400
It is all thanks to the founder's works.

00:23:22.650 --> 00:23:25.400
In order to repay my debt to him,

00:23:25.860 --> 00:23:29.240
I developed a way
to make Hues even clearer.

00:23:29.950 --> 00:23:30.950
Developed?

00:23:31.110 --> 00:23:35.280
Treatment using
the ultimate state of mind, Eternal White.

00:23:36.290 --> 00:23:40.750
Shockingly white, isn't it?
This is how far humans can go.

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:44.750
New Town has at last become
a power vacuum.

00:23:45.340 --> 00:23:47.460
In accordance with Sibyl's blessings,

00:23:47.710 --> 00:23:51.760
I will build a paradise
to welcome the founder there.

00:23:54.220 --> 00:23:58.640
I never expected the Public Safety Bureau
to launch an undercover investigation.

00:23:59.100 --> 00:24:00.350
How did you know?

00:24:01.100 --> 00:24:03.350
When you heard of Auma's death,

00:24:03.480 --> 00:24:05.770
it startled your wife.

00:24:06.110 --> 00:24:07.980
That reaction was out of character.

00:24:08.820 --> 00:24:12.280
I wanted to leave you free
to flush out MOFA spies,

00:24:12.400 --> 00:24:15.450
but things are different
now that you've seen the founder.

00:24:16.410 --> 00:24:17.660
Foreign Affairs?

00:24:22.710 --> 00:24:24.290
You're a poor actor.

00:24:30.630 --> 00:24:32.220
Hello, First.

00:24:32.340 --> 00:24:34.680
Hard at work, I see, Third.

00:24:35.010 --> 00:24:36.140
I'm flattered.

00:24:47.900 --> 00:24:50.690
Young lady, red roses would suit you

00:24:51.190 --> 00:24:54.700
better than handcuffs. What a shame.

00:25:00.660 --> 00:25:02.620
Are you OK with the founder's absence?

00:25:04.120 --> 00:25:05.620
The founder is present.

00:25:06.040 --> 00:25:10.300
That's a disease
called eustress deficiency, Third.

00:25:11.420 --> 00:25:12.630
It is no disease.

00:25:15.260 --> 00:25:17.340
You're incredible, in a way.

00:25:18.180 --> 00:25:22.730
You invented a system that can induce
eustress deficiency in others.

00:25:23.060 --> 00:25:25.730
It is the state of Eternal White.

00:25:26.520 --> 00:25:30.360
Would you care to undergo treatment,
First? You'll be happy.

00:25:30.940 --> 00:25:35.030
I love my job
more than personal happiness.

00:25:35.200 --> 00:25:38.160
But I'm worried about your Hues.

00:25:38.910 --> 00:25:42.660
Excessive violence leads
to Psycho-Pass deterioration.

00:25:43.080 --> 00:25:47.500
Of course. Violence not permitted
by Sibyl is abominable.

00:25:47.710 --> 00:25:48.380
So?

00:25:48.540 --> 00:25:50.880
I'll use the survivors of Peacebreaker.

00:25:51.750 --> 00:25:55.880
The two pathfinders?
You'd use those lowlifes?

00:25:56.630 --> 00:25:58.550
National Center for Medical Research

00:25:58.930 --> 00:26:01.060
The operation was a total success.

00:26:01.310 --> 00:26:04.060
You'll be able to see Kei's face
in a few days.

00:26:04.480 --> 00:26:06.810
Is Kei working?

00:26:06.980 --> 00:26:07.850
Sorry.

00:26:08.480 --> 00:26:09.770
Why apologize?

00:26:10.520 --> 00:26:15.990
I'm sorry that I'll be the first
person you get to see.

00:26:16.700 --> 00:26:19.450
Don't be. Thank you.

00:26:19.620 --> 00:26:21.200
I'm happy to hear your voice.

00:26:21.950 --> 00:26:23.950
I'm glad you're relieved.

00:26:24.790 --> 00:26:25.410
Um...

00:26:26.460 --> 00:26:29.080
I want to ask you a favor about Kei.

00:26:29.250 --> 00:26:29.920
What?

00:26:30.130 --> 00:26:33.550
He always believes that
he can protect people.

00:26:33.960 --> 00:26:37.300
But people like him
are always the ones being protected.

00:26:38.220 --> 00:26:40.430
Kei doesn't realize that.

00:26:41.800 --> 00:26:46.100
I know, but I can't help relying on him.

00:26:48.310 --> 00:26:52.940
If you can protect each other,
I'm sure you'll be fine.

00:26:59.280 --> 00:27:00.160
I know.

00:27:04.080 --> 00:27:06.290
Sorry for taking a detour.

00:27:06.500 --> 00:27:08.790
Don't be. It was on the way.

00:27:09.000 --> 00:27:10.960
I still don't get it.

00:27:11.670 --> 00:27:15.630
Where in New Town
did the Sister hide the goods?

00:27:15.920 --> 00:27:18.130
Someplace hard to find, I'd guess.

00:27:20.550 --> 00:27:21.760
The rental cars...

00:27:24.010 --> 00:27:26.100
I'm sorry I asked such a big favor.

00:27:26.600 --> 00:27:28.770
Anything for Public Safety.

00:27:41.740 --> 00:27:45.330
These are the parts they made
in the factory!

00:27:46.490 --> 00:27:48.450
Let's check the other cars.

00:27:55.500 --> 00:27:57.920
What are these white rocks?

00:27:58.800 --> 00:28:00.760
Rough diamonds.

00:28:01.300 --> 00:28:02.300
Seriously?!

00:28:03.180 --> 00:28:06.430
Diamonds are synonymous
with conflict economies.

00:28:07.100 --> 00:28:09.890
They're used to pay for weapons
and drugs.

00:28:10.730 --> 00:28:13.810
So, they used this as seed money
for smuggling?

00:28:14.230 --> 00:28:18.730
The Sister was buying weapons
and supporting foreign guerrillas?

00:28:19.570 --> 00:28:21.320
It doesn't fit.

00:28:21.740 --> 00:28:25.700
Anyway, these are the assets she seized
at Dejima.

00:28:26.200 --> 00:28:30.370
The rental cars were a shipping network,
as well as safes on wheels.

00:28:31.080 --> 00:28:33.830
They could even load suicide bombers
on them.

00:28:34.080 --> 00:28:38.670
If they did what Enomiya did with her men,

00:28:39.590 --> 00:28:41.630
they could bypass street scanners.

00:28:41.760 --> 00:28:45.970
Yes. But the important question is
where the remaining bombers are now.

00:28:46.510 --> 00:28:48.010
Let's find out.

00:28:54.730 --> 00:28:55.980
Analysis complete.

00:28:56.400 --> 00:29:01.280
That system identifies cargo
using the rental cars' load sensors.

00:29:01.490 --> 00:29:03.200
It controls all shipping.

00:29:03.570 --> 00:29:08.740
I've found signs that someone
checked this data recently.

00:29:09.410 --> 00:29:11.410
Can you identify the user?

00:29:11.750 --> 00:29:13.040
Let me see...

00:29:13.290 --> 00:29:18.500
The user account belonged to
one of the administrators, Kurisu O'Brien.

00:29:19.040 --> 00:29:21.630
If it was Kurisu, he'd have to be a ghost.

00:29:21.760 --> 00:29:23.880
The user was the Sister.

00:29:25.300 --> 00:29:26.590
What's wrong?

00:29:27.550 --> 00:29:30.720
I remembered something troubling
on the second floor.

00:29:32.270 --> 00:29:35.560
This is a caregiver drone on
a life-support program, right?

00:29:35.980 --> 00:29:38.860
This is the one thing
that doesn't make any sense.

00:29:49.070 --> 00:29:50.740
Sister Shinogi, right?

00:29:52.790 --> 00:29:55.540
Good job. You saw right through me.

00:29:56.830 --> 00:29:58.750
Who were you protecting here?

00:29:58.880 --> 00:30:00.630
That doesn't matter now.

00:30:00.790 --> 00:30:03.050
That's the suicide bombers' next target.

00:30:03.510 --> 00:30:04.880
Get out, now!

00:30:07.590 --> 00:30:08.760
Where are you, Shinogi?!

00:30:09.300 --> 00:30:10.430
Get out here!

00:30:15.560 --> 00:30:16.600
Help!

00:30:17.140 --> 00:30:18.690
Bring out Shinogi!

00:30:22.480 --> 00:30:24.900
Hey, calm down.

00:30:25.820 --> 00:30:27.610
Don't come any closer!

00:30:58.390 --> 00:31:01.650
The target's threat assessment
has been updated.

00:31:02.860 --> 00:31:06.320
Enforcement mode is Destroy Decomposer.

00:31:07.030 --> 00:31:09.860
Target will be completely eliminated.

00:31:10.030 --> 00:31:11.200
Don't do it!

00:31:13.080 --> 00:31:14.950
Prepare for drone disarmament!

00:31:15.240 --> 00:31:16.790
What are you thinking?!

00:31:16.910 --> 00:31:18.080
I won't let him die!

00:31:18.210 --> 00:31:20.170
You'll never make it in time!

00:31:22.210 --> 00:31:24.170
Give it a rest!

00:31:27.550 --> 00:31:28.840
What are you doing?!

00:31:29.670 --> 00:31:30.680
Shut up!

00:31:31.130 --> 00:31:31.840
Do it!

00:31:33.050 --> 00:31:34.100
Got it!

00:31:43.980 --> 00:31:45.860
We could've saved him.

00:31:47.320 --> 00:31:48.360
Inspector.

00:31:49.650 --> 00:31:52.410
He was a mad bomber coming after us!

00:31:52.820 --> 00:31:55.240
No, you're wrong!

00:31:55.620 --> 00:31:58.160
The Sister said this place was the target!

00:32:01.500 --> 00:32:04.000
I get it. Both Joseph Auma

00:32:04.380 --> 00:32:08.460
and Sister Shinogi
knew about the terrorist plan.

00:32:09.630 --> 00:32:10.840
They tried to stop it.

00:32:12.880 --> 00:32:16.350
Shion, can you trace the call
from Sister Shinogi?

00:32:17.260 --> 00:32:20.230
Got it. The special zone
press event venue.

00:32:21.020 --> 00:32:22.390
The first bombing site.

00:32:42.830 --> 00:32:46.080
He's conscious,
but seems to be in a vegetative state.

00:32:46.460 --> 00:32:50.380
The bed in the church
must've been for him.

00:32:50.670 --> 00:32:53.550
So, the Sister was hiding out here.

00:32:53.680 --> 00:32:56.600
It looks that way.
We completely overlooked it.

00:32:56.890 --> 00:32:59.560
Did she notice the trace and run?

00:32:59.760 --> 00:33:03.060
No. She deliberately let us know
where she was.

00:33:04.100 --> 00:33:06.400
All so that we would take custody of him.

00:33:08.730 --> 00:33:10.820
Can't we search Heaven's Leap yet?

00:33:11.610 --> 00:33:14.910
Our undercover officers are taking
too long to make contact!

00:33:16.110 --> 00:33:18.410
I'm working on it
with the Bureau of Culture!

00:33:19.160 --> 00:33:23.910
We sent them in there to find grounds
for a search in the first place.

00:33:25.870 --> 00:33:30.920
If we raid the place now, information
will leak and we'll come up empty-handed.

00:33:32.510 --> 00:33:35.590
We've been blocked
by believers in the Ministry of Welfare?

00:33:36.180 --> 00:33:39.350
If they haven't made contact
in another 12 hours,

00:33:39.680 --> 00:33:42.560
I'll make Bureau Chief Hosorogi
take action.

00:33:43.100 --> 00:33:45.890
You focus on clearing our way.

00:33:47.520 --> 00:33:48.400
Yes, ma'am.

00:33:48.690 --> 00:33:53.530
Listen, I know you're impatient,
but you can't push yourself too hard.

00:33:54.780 --> 00:33:59.570
I heard the report.
Your enforcers just saved your life.

00:34:00.160 --> 00:34:01.660
Be grateful to them.

00:34:03.040 --> 00:34:04.660
I'm not impatient.

00:34:04.870 --> 00:34:08.960
I want to prevent more victims,
whatever it takes.

00:34:09.250 --> 00:34:12.170
You really are like Akane.

00:34:14.510 --> 00:34:16.760
I'm saying don't overdo it.

00:34:19.510 --> 00:34:20.220
Hello?

00:34:20.470 --> 00:34:22.180
This is Hanashiro at the MOFA.

00:34:23.270 --> 00:34:26.350
We'll be taking Zaharias off your hands.

00:34:27.060 --> 00:34:28.400
What?!

00:34:29.690 --> 00:34:33.650
Trying to probe into
inspectors' affairs was foolish.

00:34:34.030 --> 00:34:38.200
Just to be safe, let me
hear everything you know.

00:34:38.860 --> 00:34:41.160
"Inspectors"?

00:34:42.910 --> 00:34:44.160
Answer me.

00:34:44.450 --> 00:34:48.580
I trust you know what will happen
to her if you don't.

00:34:53.170 --> 00:34:54.340
You bastard!

00:35:03.310 --> 00:35:04.180
Mom.

00:35:04.930 --> 00:35:08.100
Have you gotten him to talk
about the MOFA, Torri?

00:35:08.350 --> 00:35:11.190
Not yet, but I've taken measures.

00:35:12.020 --> 00:35:16.320
To think Nisei had ties
to the Ministry of Foreign Affairs.

00:35:17.030 --> 00:35:22.320
But now, we can eliminate their
influence from the immigrant community.

00:35:22.620 --> 00:35:24.580
Well done, Torri.

00:35:25.040 --> 00:35:26.490
Thank you very much.

00:35:27.000 --> 00:35:28.710
How about your game, Mom?

00:35:28.960 --> 00:35:33.000
It's going well.
There will be an opening in Bifrost soon.

00:35:33.340 --> 00:35:34.840
Bifrost?

00:35:36.250 --> 00:35:40.180
Let's settle things
while we can still use Azusawa as a pawn.

00:35:40.590 --> 00:35:42.970
The First is buttering you up, Mom.

00:35:43.470 --> 00:35:46.510
He's a useful man, but a dangerous one.

00:35:47.180 --> 00:35:50.770
I can only trust in the bond
between parent and child.

00:35:51.390 --> 00:35:52.230
That's right.

00:35:52.480 --> 00:35:56.230
Still, Kei Mikhail Ignatov.

00:35:57.650 --> 00:36:00.070
He's that Ignatov's brother, isn't he?

00:36:03.280 --> 00:36:04.740
Perhaps we were careless.

00:36:08.080 --> 00:36:09.870
The fact you picked this place

00:36:10.370 --> 00:36:14.000
means you had Heaven's Leap marked
long before we did.

00:36:14.580 --> 00:36:16.170
Any basis for thinking so?

00:36:16.750 --> 00:36:19.300
Zaharias is in their facility.

00:36:19.510 --> 00:36:21.840
We want the real one.

00:36:21.970 --> 00:36:23.340
If you know about that...

00:36:23.470 --> 00:36:26.220
Inspector Shindo, fall back!

00:36:26.350 --> 00:36:27.140
But...

00:36:27.260 --> 00:36:29.390
Just follow my orders!

00:36:30.810 --> 00:36:31.730
Yes, ma'am.

00:36:32.600 --> 00:36:37.480
I'll get straight to the point.
When did the SAD infiltrate Heaven's Leap?

00:36:42.860 --> 00:36:45.410
Stay out of domestic affairs.

00:36:45.870 --> 00:36:50.700
It's the other way around.
You're intruding on our territory.

00:36:51.330 --> 00:36:52.540
What?

00:36:53.460 --> 00:36:55.460
As a kind of trade off,

00:36:56.000 --> 00:36:58.960
I'll give you more information
about Sasagawa.

00:36:59.380 --> 00:37:02.920
He was definitely killed by a fox.

00:37:05.640 --> 00:37:07.100
Koichi Azusawa.

00:37:13.310 --> 00:37:14.270
He beat us to it!

00:37:16.060 --> 00:37:19.730
Watch the perimeter!
Detain all suspicious persons!

00:37:20.320 --> 00:37:23.530
Let's go back, Chief.
Kei and Mao are in danger.

00:37:23.820 --> 00:37:25.740
The SAD will handle things here.

00:37:27.990 --> 00:37:29.120
Ms. Hanashiro!

00:37:29.950 --> 00:37:32.370
This makes us even.

00:37:40.170 --> 00:37:44.760
Mr. and Mrs. Zaharias, who we held for
our investigation, have been murdered.

00:37:45.970 --> 00:37:49.100
Possibly an internal split
in the group we're after,

00:37:49.720 --> 00:37:51.180
but the details are hazy.

00:37:51.760 --> 00:37:53.600
Isn't that bad news?

00:37:53.770 --> 00:37:57.940
I know. I'll get a compulsory search
authorized somehow.

00:37:58.310 --> 00:38:01.610
Concentrate on your own responsibilities.

00:38:04.280 --> 00:38:07.280
I won't lose two subordinates
without a fight.

00:38:08.490 --> 00:38:10.490
I'll talk to the chief directly.

00:38:12.990 --> 00:38:14.160
Inspector Shindo,

00:38:15.500 --> 00:38:16.790
handle the scene.

00:38:16.920 --> 00:38:17.620
Yes, ma'am.

00:38:22.840 --> 00:38:25.340
Shion, let's go over what we know.

00:38:25.920 --> 00:38:27.130
You got it.

00:38:28.010 --> 00:38:33.140
According to the SAD's info,
the same type of explosive was used.

00:38:33.720 --> 00:38:37.140
That makes it the fifth
and last suicide bombing.

00:38:37.640 --> 00:38:41.480
Nearby security footage
shows a rental car.

00:38:41.900 --> 00:38:44.150
The same M.O., then.

00:38:45.690 --> 00:38:49.700
Have you identified the young man
we found at the venue?

00:38:50.320 --> 00:38:53.830
The child we took into custody
is Harris Sho Flannagan.

00:38:54.200 --> 00:38:56.750
His father is Kurisu Kyoji O'Brien.

00:38:57.040 --> 00:38:59.170
So he's Kurisu's kid?

00:38:59.330 --> 00:39:01.170
Why's he in a vegetative state?

00:39:01.920 --> 00:39:05.460
Due to an overdose
of Hue-improvement drugs.

00:39:05.800 --> 00:39:07.920
We detected abnormal quantities.

00:39:08.680 --> 00:39:11.010
Why did Sister Shinogi shelter him?

00:39:11.300 --> 00:39:13.970
Because he's her old colleague's kid.

00:39:14.560 --> 00:39:19.350
The Sister being a target demolishes
all our previous assumptions.

00:39:20.400 --> 00:39:25.480
The serial bombings have exposed
drug use in coefficient relief facilities,

00:39:26.070 --> 00:39:31.280
immigrants forced into prostitution,
and arms smuggling.

00:39:32.410 --> 00:39:34.660
Meaning the culprit's goal

00:39:35.290 --> 00:39:40.160
is to indict this country
for the crimes it's forced on immigrants.

00:39:41.330 --> 00:39:43.330
Who's the culprit, then?

00:39:44.960 --> 00:39:45.880
Maybe a ghost.

00:39:48.170 --> 00:39:52.430
This is only speculation,
but Sister Shinogi warned us,

00:39:52.840 --> 00:39:55.220
Joseph Auma ambushed a bomber,

00:39:55.600 --> 00:39:57.430
Nisei's shut up in his facility,

00:39:57.720 --> 00:39:59.060
and Kurisu was murdered.

00:39:59.680 --> 00:40:03.270
I think those four drew up a plan,
and someone else used it.

00:40:04.110 --> 00:40:08.940
Review the evidence we've found so far
with that in mind.

00:40:10.530 --> 00:40:11.780
And you, Inspector?

00:40:13.780 --> 00:40:15.370
I've got an errand to run.

00:40:19.040 --> 00:40:19.910
Inspector.

00:40:23.290 --> 00:40:26.710
You're going to do
that "Mental Trace" thing, right?

00:40:26.880 --> 00:40:28.210
No.

00:40:28.840 --> 00:40:32.220
You can't fool me
by calling it an "errand."

00:40:32.470 --> 00:40:34.590
I'm here to stop you, for the enforcers.

00:40:36.260 --> 00:40:37.600
Please let me go.

00:40:38.260 --> 00:40:42.980
Inspector Ignatov sent an email
to all us enforcers.

00:40:43.520 --> 00:40:46.480
"Don't let Inspector Shindo
act recklessly."

00:40:53.610 --> 00:40:55.620
We can't have you fainting again.

00:40:56.160 --> 00:40:58.700
We might never see them again.

00:41:02.910 --> 00:41:06.500
Promises to the dead
are pretty demanding, huh?

00:41:12.800 --> 00:41:13.800
I'm heading out.

00:41:27.310 --> 00:41:30.190
I'll be fine, Kei.

00:41:32.530 --> 00:41:33.860
It's raining.

00:42:20.950 --> 00:42:22.370
Damn it...

00:42:30.920 --> 00:42:32.050
I knew it.

00:42:33.170 --> 00:42:34.300
He's alive.

00:42:35.670 --> 00:42:38.470
Kurisu O'Brien's alive.

00:42:50.400 --> 00:42:51.060
Going home?

00:42:52.730 --> 00:42:54.070
Both of you?

00:42:56.030 --> 00:42:58.400
Yes. The army called my brother

00:42:59.240 --> 00:43:01.370
to active duty because of the war.

00:43:01.780 --> 00:43:04.700
And I'm worried about my mother.

00:43:05.500 --> 00:43:10.290
Dad says you'll both
be conscripted if you go.

00:43:11.130 --> 00:43:13.090
And you're still going?

00:43:13.460 --> 00:43:17.090
That's normal, Arata.
Outside this country, anyway.

00:43:17.340 --> 00:43:21.220
Don't worry. I'm sure
peace will come to our country, too.

00:43:21.800 --> 00:43:23.810
Then we can come back to Japan.

00:43:25.600 --> 00:43:26.930
We'll come back.

00:43:28.640 --> 00:43:30.600
Yeah. I'll be waiting.

00:43:42.410 --> 00:43:43.410
It's a promise.

00:43:43.990 --> 00:43:45.740
Yes, a promise.

00:43:46.240 --> 00:43:47.620
We'll all meet again.

00:43:53.840 --> 00:43:58.010
Maiko Maya Stronskaya, we have detected
an irregularity in your Hue.

00:43:58.630 --> 00:44:01.130
We'll rush you to a relief facility.

00:44:01.800 --> 00:44:05.220
But there was no problem
in my post-surgery checkup.

00:44:05.680 --> 00:44:07.640
Please, don't be alarmed.

00:44:11.560 --> 00:44:14.310
May Sibyl's blessings be upon you.

00:44:28.580 --> 00:44:31.580
Stupid perfection in your own castle

00:44:33.750 --> 00:44:37.420
How smart. You cause me to yawn

00:44:38.880 --> 00:44:44.300
Look,
The key to the door is in your hand

00:44:44.430 --> 00:44:49.520
Don't you let anyone take control

00:44:49.720 --> 00:44:54.850
What do you want?

00:44:55.060 --> 00:45:00.190
Go get it. Play by your own rule

00:45:00.400 --> 00:45:06.120
The winner always controls the game

00:45:06.240 --> 00:45:11.040
You stand in your belief

00:45:14.460 --> 00:45:18.960
There's no promising future

00:45:19.420 --> 00:45:24.550
Always helpless
Crying for the moon

00:45:24.760 --> 00:45:29.810
Finger trembles in fear
With the weight of the trigger

00:45:29.970 --> 00:45:33.020
There's a way for us

00:45:33.140 --> 00:45:37.150
Show them how we fight

00:45:37.310 --> 00:45:40.320
Pull the trigger

00:45:45.530 --> 00:45:47.530
"Psycho-Pass" refers to the measurement
of a person's mind and personality.

00:45:47.660 --> 00:45:49.870
This is a work of fiction. Any resemblance
to real persons or groups is coincidental.
